title: date_tsuru_4_intro
location: office
---

The end of another shift at Marine Headquarters...
You sigh in relief. Now it's time to go back to your room and chill, except... Vice Admiral Tsuru is waiting for you right outside the office, a fond smile on her lips.
Tsuru: Ah... Hello, {$name}.
Tsuru: I have a... Well, proposition for you.
-> Would you like to train together again?
    <<set td4_points +=1>>
    Tsuru laughs.
    Tsuru: It's quite good to hear you are this motivated.
    Tsuru: No, I had something different in mind.
    -> Are you... Going out somewhere?
        Tsuru: As sharp as always, {$name}.
    -> If this is about work, I'm not interested.
        <<set td4_points -=1>>
        Tsuru: ...
        Tsuru: Luckily for you, it isn't.
Tsuru: This is quite unusual however... we haven't seen each other much outside of Headquarters, but...
Tsuru: ...Well, perhaps that could change?
{$name}: (!) (I think she's asking me out on a date...)
-> Keep it cool
    {$name}: Um, sure, why not?
    Tsuru: OK!
-> Panic
    {$name} Outside of Headquarters? I think we have seen each other a lot outside of this building actually...
    Tsuru cocks her head to the side.
    Tsuru: Um... *Technically*, I suppose...
    Tsuru: I was thinking of something more along the lines of doing something together...?
        -> YES, yes I want to go on a date with you!
            <<set td4_points +=1>>
            Tsuru seems quite surprised.
            ...but pleasantly so.
            Tsuru: That's... straightforward!
            Tsuru: But maybe you'd like to hear my... *suggestion* first?
        -> What? Um...
            <<set td4_points -=1>>
            <<jump date_tsuru_4_early_end0>>
Tsuru: Some time ago, Gion and I planned to go to the theater tonight, but she is out on duty and would like me to go on my own.
Tsuru: Well, not on my own... She gave me permission to invite you.
-> I'd love to!
    <<set td4_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: Wonderful!
    Tsuru: It's at the New Marineford Hall. *A Midsummer's Night Dream*, what do you think?
    Tsuru: I am actually not that versed in theater...
    -> It will be a good time anyway!
        <<set td4_points +=1>>
        Tsuru: I'm sure it will.
    -> Oh I don't care for it either!
        <<set td4_points -=1>>
        Tsuru: OK... Well, think about it...
-> Erm no, I already have other plans...
    <<set td4_points -=1>>
    <<jump date_tsuru_4_early_end0>>
-> Wait, *me* especially? What *exactly* does she know about me?!
    <<set td4_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: Whatever I discuss with her is our business only!
    Tsuru is blushing a little bit, though.
Tsuru: I'm leaving you a note with the time and place we'll meet.
Tsuru: I will see you later!
<<jump date_tsuru_4_room>>
===

title: date_tsuru_4_early_end0
location: office
---

Tsuru: Ah... OK. I will take that as a no.
Tsuru: Well, no harm in keeping things strictly professional.
Tsuru: Have a nice evening, {$name}.
Tsuru leaves.
{$name}: Wait...
{$name}: What the hell just happened?
===

title: date_tsuru_4_room
location: quarters
---

You are back in your room, getting ready for tonight's date.
{$name}: What should I wear? Something...
-> ...classy and nice.
    <<set td4_points +=1>>
    You imagine Tsuru's reaction. She's rarely seen you made up...
    Yes... This will work to impress her!
-> ...sexy and adventurous.
    <<set td4_points -=1>>
    You imagine Tsuru's reaction.
    Ugh... You don't think she will like this.
    You're having an evening at the opera! This is for sure too much.
    You will have to wear something that doesn't match your personality to that extent.
-> ...casual and informal.
    <<set td4_points -=1>>
    You imagine Tsuru's reaction.
    You don't think she will like this. For sure, she expects you to dress up, even if you're comfortable in jeans and sneakers.
    You will have to wear something that doesn't match your personality that much.
{$name}: How about accessories? I could wear...
-> ...a tie!
    <<set td4_points +=1>>
    {$name}: This will look great on me. And Tsuru will like it if I dress formally. It's a way of showing her that I appreciate our time together.
    {$name}: I hope we don't show up wearing the same thing. That would be funny.
-> ...simple earrings!
    <<set td4_points +=1>>
    {$name}: This will look great on me, and it's fitting for the evening out.
    {$name}: I hope we don't show up wearing the same earrings. That would be funny.
-> ...high-heeled boots!
    <<set td4_points -=1>>
    {$name}: I like these boots, but they're not very practical.
    {$name}: I can't see her liking this. I won't wear it.
-> ...bright red lipstick!
    <<set td4_points -=1>>
    {$name}: I think bright red lipstick looks great on me, but it's a bit flashy.
    {$name}: I can't see her liking this. I won't wear it.
-> ...no accessories at all!
    {$name}: Can't go wrong this way!
{$name}: Oh! There's something else.
{$name}: My transponder snail...
{$name}: If I don't take it, and there are any calls from work, I'll miss them.
-> I should probably keep it.
    Duty is duty. You put the snail in your pocket.
    You're ready to go!
    <<jump date_tsuru_4_with_snail>>
-> I should probably leave it here. It's my day off, anyway.
    It's your night off. You're entitled to it. You leave the snail in your room.
    You're ready to go!
    <<jump date_tsuru_4_no_snail>>
===

title: date_tsuru_4_with_snail
location: town
---

You make your way to the New Marineford town. It's Friday, and the night is warm and breezy. The night lights and busy streets make for a comfortable atmosphere.
*Bere-bere-bere-bere!*
{$name}: Hello, this is {$name}.
Tsuru: Hello! How are you, dear {$name}?
Tsuru: I'm ready, a bit earlier than expected... Would you like to come pick me up?
Tsuru: Or should we meet there earlier?
-> I'd like to visit you!
    Tsuru: Very well. I'll wait for you, {$name}.
    <<jump date_tsuru_4_with_snail_home>>
-> Let's meet earlier!
    Tsuru: Very well.
    <<jump date_tsuru_4_with_snail_queue>>
===

title: date_tsuru_4_with_snail_home
location: town
---

It takes a few minutes to get there on foot. Tsuru lives in a nice, quaint house in a quiet corner of town. It is surrounded by a gate, thick with ivy; there is a pond, a birdhouse, and a few plants in beautiful pots. Warm light pours out through the patterned window curtains.
She has obviously put care into making her home cozy. You ring the bell.
Tsuru answers the door, nicely dressed.
Tsuru: Ah! {$name}. I am so glad you came here.
You look down, where something *fuzzy*...? brushes against your legs.
A cat!
-> Oh! Kitty kitty~
    Tsuru: That's Yuki. She seems to like you...
    Tsuru: But please don't pet her! She gets scared easily.
-> Can I pet it?
    Tsuru: Oh! Well, Yuki seems to like you.
    Tsuru: Let her get comfortable and approach you first, please.
-> Get it away from me!
    <<set td4_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: I didn't realize you don't like cats.
    Tsuru: It seemed like something important to note...
    Well, that sounded ominous. Tsuru places the cat somewhere inside the house, and then comes back to greet you.
Tsuru: Please, come in, {$name}. I have fixed a tea for us before we get going.
-> Compliment her
    <<set td4_points +=1>>
    {$name}: You look beautiful!
    Tsuru blushes slightly.
    Tsuru: Ah... Well, thank you, {$name}.
-> Serve her tea first
    <<set td4_points -=1>>
    You take the teapot.
    Tsuru: {$name}, I'd rather you...
    ...You spill a few drops on the coffee table.
    Tsuru: ...Be careful.... And besides, you're my guest! You shouldn't be the one to serve me tea. Sit down!
The two of you sit together around her table, cat purring on the cozy carpet.
Tsuru serves herbal tea for you both and a few pastries in the shape of flowers.
-> Make small talk about work.
    <<set td4_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: I see that you have brought your transponder with you.
    Tsuru: I, too, am technically on duty all night, since Gion is gone.
    Tsuru: Well... That's how things are in our line of duty, isn't it?
    Tsuru: But I digress...
-> Ask about the theater.
    {$name}: Have you gone to see a lot of plays like this before?
    Tsuru chuckles.
    Tsuru: Not really, no. It's rare. But I am happy that New Marineford has grown enough that there's an opera, and concerts.
    -> I'm not sure I like the idea, going to see some play while there's work to do. (-)
        Tsuru: I don't think there is any harm in escapism.
    -> I love it! I'd go to watch all kinds of opera and musicals if I could! (+)
        Tsuru: I like your enthusiasm! Maybe you can teach me a few things about it, then...
    -> I have no idea about the play.
        Tsuru laughs.
        Tsuru: We are both quite green, then.
-> Ask about her family.
    {$name}: Do you and Gion usually do a lot of things together in your free time?         Tsuru: Yes, indeed! As you know, she used to be one of my cadets. She is like a sister to me!
    -> She seems very nice...
        <<set td4_points +=1>>
        Tsuru: I think we should all gather together sometime.
    -> And now she's surpassed you, eh?
        Tsuru chuckles.
        Tsuru: Often, a disciple will grow more than the master...
    -> She really should have gotten that Admiral position, huh?
        <<set td4_points -=1>>
        Tsuru sighs.
        Tsuru: Ah... I've discussed this at length with her.
        Tsuru: I would rather not talk about politics now, if you don't mind.
-> Comment on the tea.
    {$name}: This is delicious!
    Tsuru: Thank you. These are cherry blossom biscuits.
    {$name}: I know I've seen these pastries somewhere before...
    Tsuru smiles slightly.
    Tsuru: The Fleet Admiral favors them. He used to be my disciple, too.
    - {$name} Fleet Admiral Sakazuki, that psychopath?! <<set td4_points -=1>>
        Tsuru: I wouldn't say that about my boss if I were you...
    - {$name} Um... I wasn't expecting that. <<set td4_points +=1>>(+)
        {$name}: You have some odd friends, Tsuru.
        Tsuru chuckles.
        Tsuru: That might be true.
        Tsuru: Sakazuki is not the only one—it is surprising the things some of the most feared people in the world have to say, when one listens.
        Tsuru: Perhaps you have heard of a certain Warlord, Donquixote Doflamingo... Well, that's a topic for another day.
Your conversation continues until it is almost time to go.
Tsuru: Ah! Time flies when you have good company...
But!
A sudden ring cuts through her words!
Snail: *Bere-bere-bere-bere!*
You and Tsuru exchange glances.
Tsuru: Hm. I'll get that.
Tsuru: Tsuru here.
Officer: Lady Tsuru! I didn't want to interrupt you, but Vice Admiral Gion is on the other side of the Grand Line and... We have a situation over here!
Tsuru: A situation?
-> What is their location? Can we help them?
    <<set td4_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: Let me ask.
    Tsuru: How serious is the problem?
-> Oh, great. Can we ever have one day off?
    <<set td4_points -=1>>
    Tsuru signals at you to stop.
    Tsuru: This sounds serious, {$name}. Let me talk.
-> You feel disappointed but say nothing.
    Tsuru: How serious is the problem?
Officer: Well... We are trying to return to HQ with some captures we made. But three pirate vessels are blocking us and keeping us from leaving!
Officer: We have sent a distress signal to all officers of your division. But our communications could break off at any moment.
-> Blocking? Are they trying to save the captured pirates?
    <<set td4_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: Good question.
    Officer: They haven't made any demands yet.
-> We have to go help them.
    Tsuru: Yes. We do.
    Tsuru: At the bare minimum, we'll have to inform the higher command and dispatch some officers.
    Tsuru: Three ships...
-> Sulk
    <<set td4_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: Understood.
    Tsuru: {$name}. We have to help.
    Tsuru: I understand if you don't want to come with me, but our plans will have to wait.
    <<jump date_tsuru_4_end00>>
Tsuru: Come, {$name}. There is no time to lose.
You gather your Marine coats in a rush and make your way toward the docks...
<<jump date_tsuru_4_on_ship>>
===

title: date_tsuru_4_with_snail_queue
location: town
---

You make your way to the theater.
A very nice, old building, with patterns sculpted on its facade. A sharply dressed public is already gathering outside.
A few minutes later, Tsuru waves to you. She is so nicely dressed!
Tsuru: Ah! Hello, {$name}. I hope I didn't keep you waiting.
-> Compliment her
    <<set td4_points +=1>>
